        "slc_44e4f1846afd41d712c5ab13577f775aa05e44461ca53b948bb4cdd029deb134"
      ],
      "text": "On Unix, the MCP adapter is separated from PTY-owning processes: winxd manages the control plane and one winx-guardian per session keeps shells alive across disconnects and adapter upgrades."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c8e4d665c37d330a8a24ba66bf52949e3d865968f2595414dd4a8a11446a144e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
