      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_28115d11fc7dd16d83ae7a637f8be199dce5e703e6bd6626263823b999c99747"
      ],
      "text": "The README warns that a valid principal is equivalent to shell and file access as the OS user, and that BashCommand in wcgw mode is not workspace-confined."
    }
